      "index": 0,
      "sectionIndex": 0,
      "section": "The deal",
      "text": "$330 million dollars. Up front.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "stat",
        "raw": "$330M | upfront",
        "value": "$330M",
        "label": "upfront"
      },
      "startMs": 50,
      "endMs": 3600
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "sectionIndex": 0,
      "section": "The deal",
      "text": "That's what Pfizer just paid to license three pre-IND in vivo CAR T programs from Starna Therapeutics... with up to $2.3 billion in milestones behind it.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "stat",
        "raw": "$2.3B | in milestones",
        "value": "$2.3B",
        "label": "in milestones"
      },
      "startMs": 3600,
      "endMs": 14300
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "sectionIndex": 1,
      "section": "The bet",
      "text": "CAR T has always been cancer medicine. Remove the patient's T-cells. Engineer them in a lab. Re-infuse. Expensive, slow, bespoke. Starna's bet is different... engineer the T-cells inside the patient, using RNA.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"inside the patient\"",
        "phrase": "inside the patient"
      },
      "startMs": 14300,
      "endMs": 30440
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "sectionIndex": 2,
      "section": "The target",
      "text": "And the first target isn't cancer. It's autoimmune disease... a market an order of magnitude larger than cancer CAR T.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"autoimmune disease\"",
        "phrase": "autoimmune disease"
      },
      "startMs": 30440,
      "endMs": 37843
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "sectionIndex": 3,
      "section": "The catch",
      "text": "Three programs. None yet in people. The next real read is an IND filing. Until then... $330 million is the price of a platform option... not a product.",
      "cue": {
        "type": "emphasize",
        "raw": "\"not a product\"",
        "phrase": "not a product"
      },
      "startMs": 37843,
      "endMs": 48907
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "sectionIndex": 4,
      "section": "Subscribe",
      "text": "Signal over noise. This week's Catalyst Brief. Subscribe free.",
      "cue": null,
      "startMs": 48907,
